---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Ethnoir"
  description="Ethnoir exists to strengthen people’s ability to navigate their ventures with informed judgment."
>
  <!-- SECTION A: OPENING (PURPOSE) -->
  <section class="bg-parchment" style="padding: var(--space-lg) 0 var(--space-xl) 0;">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">
        <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">About</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-12 md-col-11" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <h1 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.75rem); margin: 0; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--color-tidal-ink);">
          Ethnoir exists to strengthen people’s ability to navigate their ventures with informed judgment.
        </h1>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-12 grid-12" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary); padding-top: var(--space-lg);">
        <div class="col-12 md-col-5 padding-right-md" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-deep-teal); margin: 0;">
            Building or changing a venture rarely follows a completely known path. People make consequential decisions while working with incomplete information, competing priorities and circumstances that continue to evolve.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 md-col-6 padding-left-md md-col-7-offset" style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0;">
            Ethnoir helps bring those conditions into clearer view so people navigating ventures can better understand what they are facing and consider what may deserve attention next.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION B: HOW ETHNOIR SEES VENTURE DEVELOPMENT -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4">
        <h2 class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">How Ethnoir sees venture development</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8">
        <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); max-width: 640px;">
          What matters depends on the venture.
        </h3>
        
        <div style="max-width: 680px;">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            A growing company, a deliberately small business, a new undertaking and a venture facing redirection or closure do not necessarily need the same things.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            An indicator that matters greatly in one situation may be less important in another. A resource that helps one Founder may create unnecessary pressure or distraction for someone pursuing a different direction.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
            This does not mean every decision requires extensive analysis or a customized solution. Sometimes one factor is decisive. Sometimes a standard approach is appropriate. The important question is whether the conclusion fits the evidence, purpose and circumstances involved.
          </p>
          
          <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--color-tidal-ink); padding-left: var(--space-md);">
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); font-weight: 500; margin: 0;">
              Ethnoir does not assume that every venture should pursue funding, rapid growth, scale or continuation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION C: CAPITAL IS NOT THE DEFAULT ANSWER -->
  <section class="bg-quiet-sand" style="padding: var(--space-xl) 0;">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8 md-col-3-offset text-center" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p class="voice-1" style="font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">
          Understanding the venture’s conditions comes before assuming capital is the answer.
        </p>
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-deep-teal); margin: 0;">
          Capital may be appropriate, but it is not the automatic starting point or destination.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION D: WHERE ETHNOIR CONTRIBUTES -->
  <section class="bg-parchment chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate);">Where Ethnoir contributes</span>
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-top: var(--space-sm); max-width: 800px; color: var(--color-tidal-ink);">
          Connecting venture conditions, judgment and support
        </h2>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Core Statement -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-10" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--color-deep-teal); margin: 0;">
          Ethnoir works in the space between what is happening in a venture, the decisions people must make and the support available around them.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Two Arenas -->
      <div class="col-12 grid-12" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <div class="col-12 md-col-6 padding-right-md border-right-md" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6;">
            For people navigating ventures, that can mean making sense of current conditions and considering what may deserve attention or further investigation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 md-col-6 padding-left-md">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6;">
            For organizations shaping entrepreneurship, it can mean examining how venture conditions are understood and how related support is designed, delivered or directed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Synthesis -->
      <div class="col-12 grid-12" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); padding-top: var(--space-md);">
        <div class="col-12 md-col-8">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            These are different applications of the same concern: helping decisions about venture direction and support rest on a clearer understanding of the circumstances that matter.
          </p>
          <a href="/for-organizations" class="link-secondary voice-3" style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink);">For Organizations &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION E: HOW ETHNOIR APPROACHES THE WORK -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4">
        <h2 class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">How Ethnoir approaches the work</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8">
        <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); color: var(--color-tidal-ink);">
          Make information useful—not merely available.
        </h3>
        
        <div style="max-width: 680px;">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            Ethnoir organizes and explains information in ways intended to support understanding and judgment.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
            That means considering the goals and circumstances of the people or organizations the work is meant to serve. Support should not be recommended simply because it is available, familiar or preferred.
          </p>
          
          <div style="background: var(--color-parchment); padding: var(--space-lg); border-left: 2px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">
              Ethnoir’s conclusions also remain tied to the evidence. When the evidence supports a clear conclusion, the work should communicate it clearly. When important uncertainty remains, it should not be hidden to make the answer sound more definitive.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-deep-teal); font-weight: 500; margin: 0;">
            The purpose is not to make every question complicated. It is to be appropriately clear, careful and useful.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION F: FOUNDER-LED, DEVELOPING THROUGH PRACTICE -->
  <section class="bg-quiet-sand chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4">
        <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">Founder-led, developing through practice</span>
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">Ethnoir today</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8">
        <div style="max-width: 680px;">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            Ethnoir is currently led by its Founder, Olajumoke Michael.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            Ethnoir is developing its work through practice: making venture conditions easier to understand, helping people consider what may deserve attention, designing structured founder support and learning from what happens in delivery.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); color: var(--color-deep-body-ink);">
            Ethnoir’s current organizational evidence comes primarily from founder-facing work, including the Venture Readiness Lab.
          </p>
          
          <a href="/our-work" class="btn-primary" style="background-color: var(--color-tidal-ink); color: var(--color-porcelain);">View Our Work</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION G: ABOUT OLAJUMOKE MICHAEL -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <!-- Portrait Column (if image available) or Title -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-5 padding-right-md" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <img src="/images/ola.jpeg" alt="Olajumoke Michael, Founder of Ethnoir" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/5; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-md); filter: grayscale(10%);" onerror="this.style.display='none';" />
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">About Olajumoke Michael</h2>
        <h3 class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.4; max-width: 300px;">
          Experience across programs, institutions and entrepreneurship support
        </h3>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Bio Text -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-7 padding-left-md" style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);">
        <div style="max-width: 600px;">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--color-muted-slate); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); padding-bottom: var(--space-sm); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);">
            Ethnoir was founded in 2025. Ethnoir is based in Winston-Salem, North Carolina.
          </p>
          
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            She brings cross-sector experience across program strategy, operations, implementation and stakeholder engagement in entrepreneurship, nonprofit, higher-education, government and economic-development settings.
          </p>
          
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
            Her professional experience includes serving as U.S. Program Manager for Bpeace’s Breaking the $1M Barrier program and as Former Program Director, Winston-Salem Women’s Business Center.
          </p>
          
          <div style="background: var(--color-parchment); padding: var(--space-md);">
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
              Olajumoke holds an MSc Environmental Management from the University of South Wales and a BSc Microbiology from Olabisi Onabanjo University.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION H: NEXT PATHWAYS -->
  <section class="bg-tidal-ink chapter chapter-large-spacing">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); text-align: center;">
        <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-quiet-sand); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">Next pathways</span>
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(--color-porcelain); margin: 0;">Explore Ethnoir</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid-12">
        <!-- Path 1 -->
        <div class="col-12 md-col-4 pathway-card">
          <p class="voice-2 pathway-text">
            For organizations: Examine Ethnoir’s approach to venture-development and entrepreneurship-support questions.
          </p>
          <a href="/for-organizations" class="btn-primary" style="background-color: var(--color-porcelain); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); display: inline-block;">For Organizations</a>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Path 2 -->
        <div class="col-12 md-col-4 pathway-card">
          <p class="voice-2 pathway-text">
            For people navigating ventures: Explore a short resource for considering what may deserve attention next.
          </p>
          <a href="/venture-readiness-check-in" class="btn-primary" style="background-color: var(--color-porcelain); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); display: inline-block;">Explore the Check-In</a>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Path 3 -->
        <div class="col-12 md-col-4 pathway-card" style="border-right: none;">
          <p class="voice-2 pathway-text">
            To review current organizational evidence: Read about the Venture Readiness Lab.
          </p>
          <a href="/our-work/venture-readiness-lab" class="link-secondary voice-3" style="color: var(--color-parchment); font-size: 1rem;">View Our Work &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .col-12 { grid-column: span 12; }
  .text-center { text-align: center; }
  
  /* Next Pathways specific styles */
  .pathway-card {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .pathway-text {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-parchment);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .md-col-8 { grid-column: span 8; }
    .md-col-4 { grid-column: span 4; }
    .md-col-7 { grid-column: span 7; }
    .md-col-5 { grid-column: span 5; }
    .md-col-6 { grid-column: span 6; }
    .md-col-10 { grid-column: span 10; }
    .md-col-11 { grid-column: span 11; }
    .md-col-7-offset { grid-column: 6 / span 7; }
    .md-col-3-offset { grid-column: 3 / span 8; }
    
    .border-right-md { border-right: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); }
    .padding-right-md { padding-right: var(--space-lg); }
    .padding-left-md { padding-left: var(--space-lg); }
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .pathway-card {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }
    .pathway-card:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .md-col-7-offset {
      border-left: none !important;
      padding-top: var(--space-md);
    }
  }
</style>
